  "description": "Yun Su-Hyeon, the ace of the vampire hunter team. Traumatized by a childhood accident, Su-Hyeon is not only an outsider within the team, but even his teammates shun him.\n\n *\"There we go again, you know?\"*\n\nThen one day, the man Su-Hyeon, who insists on never sleeping with someone you've slept with twice, joins Alpha Team as his successor. And what's more, they have to live under the same roof?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
